2445:- CRM extraction has 30 scalar fields and 7 grids. `data/godrej_extract_schema.json` has `locations` (`location`, `tiv_amount`, `coordinates`), while `structured_data_result.json` supplies scalars/grids/statuses/warnings/evidence but is not a full object geospatial model. `underwriting_input_package_v2.json` has `appetiteRelevantFacts`/`appetiteProfile`, not location-level coordinates, CRESTA, radii, or accumulation limits. [Task 1]
2580:scope: Use for a narrow FBS “Новые” warehouse filter or status-group/polling correction that must be merged and deployed; keep the operator-facing UI minimal and validate the full WB-status-to-tab path.
2698:- The feature merged to `main` at `d9f71c3...`; full pytest was `1363 passed, 4 skipped, 7 warnings`, targeted tests `15 passed`, frontend build and Wiki guard passed. Railway services reported the merge SHA/healthy state. [Task 2]
2702:- Initial specification was too shallow; start with code-grounded task artifacts. Docs-only validation does not prove feature implementation, and a green full suite before coding was not feature proof. [Task 1]
