2961:- A full local OSINT gate requires PostgreSQL: `PYTHONPATH=. .venv/bin/python -m pytest -q` was `1328 passed, 4 skipped, 7 warnings`; targeted Ruff and `git diff --check` passed. `bafc0c5` was pushed only to `feat/osint-enrichment`; `main` and production were unchanged. [Task 2]
2963:- Migration verification must include an actual `008 -> 009` schema upgrade with legacy rows. Do not run migration tests in parallel with the full suite against one PostgreSQL database: the first run saw `AdminShutdown`/`UndefinedTable`; isolated validation was `1335 passed, 8 skipped, 8 warnings`. [Task 3]
