3214:- The profile OSINT suite passed `76 passed, 5 warnings in 78.75s`; a previously reported full gate was `1097 passed, 2 skipped`, but `.venv/bin/ruff check app tests` had 92 errors including OSINT files. These are local signals, not production certification. [Task 3]
3218:- Product flow is `structured result → OSINT search when runMethod=full → adjudication → externalContext → cockpit v3.2`; do not couple cockpit version to run fullness. Preserve OSINT-only fingerprinting, source normalization, deduplication/locking, checkpoints, provider incidents, and paid-call replay protection; explicit v3.1 removal is a later task after confirming no active/queued production v3.1 runs. [Task 5][Task 7] [ad-hoc note]
3223:- A normal full paid sequence is 3 initial searches + 3 retries + 1 adjudication + 1 cockpit = 8; the recorded budget was `$5` default / `$10` validation ceiling. Production remains blocked by one clean SHA, DB/Celery fault proof, migrations 006/007 and RLS, CRM E2E, an OSINT-only deadline, Railway sandbox, 50/5 burst, and 200/day capacity evidence. [Task 6]
